WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.162 --> 00:00:01.621
He wears a diaper just like you do.

00:00:01.621 --> 00:00:04.204
(bouncy music)

00:00:06.509 --> 00:00:09.512
My name is Adam and this
is my little girl Samantha.

00:00:09.512 --> 00:00:12.026
And this is her favorite stuffed animal.

00:00:12.026 --> 00:00:13.943
You give Mono big hugs?

00:00:15.315 --> 00:00:17.446
Aw, give Mono kisses?

00:00:17.446 --> 00:00:18.997
You like monkey?

00:00:18.997 --> 00:00:20.101
What does the monkey say?

00:00:20.101 --> 00:00:21.040
Uh uh.

00:00:21.040 --> 00:00:23.792
That's right, and today I'm
going to do a magic trick

00:00:23.792 --> 00:00:26.357
and turn it into a real animal for her.

00:00:26.357 --> 00:00:28.379
(mischievous percussion)

00:00:28.379 --> 00:00:29.832
(baby talk)

00:00:29.832 --> 00:00:32.123
Hi, Nano, that's right, that's Nano.

00:00:32.123 --> 00:00:36.133
Mono is Spanish for monkey
and she pronounces it Nano.

00:00:36.133 --> 00:00:37.405
All right, are you ready?

00:00:37.405 --> 00:00:38.264
Mmhmm.

00:00:38.264 --> 00:00:39.240
All right, you want to close your eyes,

00:00:39.240 --> 00:00:40.955
you want to play peekaboo with Nano?

00:00:40.955 --> 00:00:41.788
Yeah.

00:00:41.788 --> 00:00:42.677
Yeah? All right.

00:00:42.677 --> 00:00:44.221
Peekaboo, close your eyes.

00:00:44.221 --> 00:00:48.163
(magical whoosh sound)

00:00:48.163 --> 00:00:51.437
Okay, one, two, three, peekaboo.

00:00:51.437 --> 00:00:52.453
(baby talk)

00:00:52.453 --> 00:00:53.370
Who's that?

00:00:55.019 --> 00:00:56.472
What is that?

00:00:56.472 --> 00:00:57.796
Nano.

00:00:57.796 --> 00:00:59.128
That's right, that's a monkey.

00:00:59.128 --> 00:00:59.990
What does a monkey say?

00:00:59.990 --> 00:01:01.822
Look at the monkey go.

00:01:01.822 --> 00:01:02.959
(sound of Samantha giggling)

00:01:02.959 --> 00:01:04.811
Do you like the monkey, is he doing tr...

00:01:04.811 --> 00:01:05.644
Is he doing funny tricks?

00:01:05.644 --> 00:01:06.477
- [Samantha] Yeah.

00:01:06.477 --> 00:01:08.418
Yeah, look at him go.

00:01:08.418 --> 00:01:09.670
Say hi, monkey.

00:01:09.670 --> 00:01:12.337
Hi (giggles).

00:01:17.643 --> 00:01:19.112
Oop, there he goes.

00:01:19.112 --> 00:01:20.512
There he goes.

00:01:20.512 --> 00:01:23.003
(baby fussing)

00:01:23.003 --> 00:01:23.836
Nano.

00:01:26.467 --> 00:01:28.123
There's Nano.

00:01:28.123 --> 00:01:29.013
Do you love Nano?

00:01:29.013 --> 00:01:29.846
Yeah.

00:01:30.954 --> 00:01:32.197
Yeah, there he is.

00:01:32.197 --> 00:01:34.552
There's the monkey.

00:01:34.552 --> 00:01:36.672
You just want at it real bad, don't you?

00:01:36.672 --> 00:01:37.963
Is the monkey eating?

00:01:37.963 --> 00:01:38.796
- [Samantha] Uh huh.

00:01:38.796 --> 00:01:39.933
Yeah.

00:01:39.933 --> 00:01:40.766
Nano.

00:01:41.923 --> 00:01:44.515
Hi, Nano, say hi, Nano.

00:01:44.515 --> 00:01:48.098
Up, yeah, the monkey
went up, that's right.

00:01:50.648 --> 00:01:51.481
Careful.

00:01:52.552 --> 00:01:53.787
All right, let's say bye bye.

00:01:53.787 --> 00:01:54.620
Say bye bye.

00:01:54.620 --> 00:01:55.453
Bye.

00:01:55.453 --> 00:01:56.286
Bye.

00:01:57.166 --> 00:01:59.523
Here we go, one, two, three,

00:01:59.523 --> 00:02:01.725
(magical whooshing sound)

00:02:01.725 --> 00:02:04.583
and then boop, there's
monkey, there's Nano.

00:02:04.583 --> 00:02:06.373
So this was awesome for me.

00:02:06.373 --> 00:02:08.283
I could tell that she
really liked the monkey.

00:02:08.283 --> 00:02:09.648
She just kept trying to get
at it and give him big hugs,

00:02:09.648 --> 00:02:12.781
like she does with her stuffed animal.

00:02:12.781 --> 00:02:14.256
I don't know if she bought the fact

00:02:14.256 --> 00:02:17.072
that the animal switched
into the monkey or not,

00:02:17.072 --> 00:02:19.132
but she had a good time.

00:02:19.132 --> 00:02:20.781
Until we took the monkey away, of course.

00:02:20.781 --> 00:02:22.251
(baby fussing)

00:02:22.251 --> 00:02:23.341
Okay, okay.

00:02:23.341 --> 00:02:26.174
(energetic music)

